      "description": "The transformed 5/5 flying haste commander attaches a kill piece free each combat: Excalibur alone is a two-hit clock in the air; with Fireshrieker it is 30 commander damage in one swing; Aettir and Priwen makes power equal to life total."
    },
    {
      "title": "Deployed arsenal beatdown",
